The author reports a clipped SDT toolbar label and a transparent status window
in the first installed build. Correct the extension UI only: override the
icon-width toolbar styling, give the root and body explicit opaque colors,
and wrap status text. Do not change extraction admission or native worker state.

The isolated smoke driver in `verification/probes/sdt-sitter-harness/` now
checks rendered button width, computed opaque background and wrapping, in
addition to generation, statistics and disable cleanup. The original smoke
only established DOM presence and did not test these visual properties.

Deliver a new versioned XPI in the author's home without replacing the old
artifact or installing into the live profile. Updating the extension resets
its session-only census and estimates; native persisted packs remain reusable.

Passing real-Zotero evidence, with source digests:
`bench/results/sdt-sitter-launch-2026-09-05/ui-fix.json`.
